CSA303 Lab 2 – Splunk Incident Investigation
Overview

This repository contains my CSA303 Digital Forensics and Incident Response Lab 2, 
which focused on investigating a historical cybersecurity incident using Splunk 
Enterprise and the BOTS v3 dataset. The objective was to identify suspicious activity, 
perform cross-source correlation, reconstruct the incident timeline, and develop a detection 
prototype based on the investigation findings.
